<title>USA: TABLE- Hudson Foods Q3 operating shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Hudson Foods Q3 operating shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROGERS, Ark. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter ended</p>
<p>			June 28 1997		 June 29 1996</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.49   profit	 $0.11</p>
<p> Oper shr  profit	  0.17   profit	  0.11</p>
<p> Net	 loss	    14.9   profit	   3.3</p>
<p> Revs			 435.4		    337.2</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    30.3		     30.4</p>
<p>Nine months</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.03   profit	 $0.47</p>
<p> Oper shr  profit	  0.69   profit	  0.47</p>
<p> Net	 profit	   1.0   profit	  14.2</p>
<p> Revs			 1,232		    1,008</p>
<p> Avg			   30.5		     30.4</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Hudson Foods Inc took a one-time after-tax charge of $20.0 million, or $0.66 a share, in the third quarter of 1997 to reorganize its international division.</p>
